+/*
+ * Plotina: the full-screen updater page.
+ *
+ * The same stages as Plotina Mobile's updater route (lib/pages/updater/plotina_updater_page.dart):
+ * a Scaffold with a TopAppBar, one centred column no wider than 480 dp, 24 dp of body padding, a
+ * 56 dp stage icon, a headline, optional body text, a card for the version / notes / size, and
+ * stretch buttons. Every colour comes from the MaterialTheme that ElementThemeApp installs, so the
+ * page follows the user's light/dark choice and the Compound palette like the rest of the app.
+ *
